  CellName: Hedgerow
  Description: 'Labyrinth - intensity 4 of Hedgerow: sixteen thick hedges out by the membrane, and two
    crystals to armour your walls. The standard 1200 u cell with its nucleus (~392 u), no
    environment, no flora and no fauna. The field (16 hedges of 40 x 3 bricks, 1,920 prisms
    in all, 897 u out) is laid by HedgerowController. 2 omni crystals respawn inside the
    nucleus (the scene''s CrystalManager). Frenzy sits 25% above the full arena (12,720
    prisms, 915,840 volume). Authored by Tools/Build/author_hedgerow_assets.py - re-run it
    rather than hand-editing.'
